DMESG(8)                   System Administration                    DMESG(8)

NAME
    dmesg - print the kernel's message log

SYNOPSIS
    dmesg

DESCRIPTION
    Print the kernel's message ring: what it said at boot and since.

SECURITY
    The kernel asks whether the shell's task holds CAP_KERNEL_LOG, and
    nothing else decides. init lends the shell that capability when the
    administrator logs in and takes it back at logout, so in any other
    account's session the kernel refuses.

SEE ALSO
    ps(1)
